{
  "title": { "zh": "同一张图，不同的世界", "en": "One image, different worlds" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "图形学从物体、光照和相机出发，正向渲出一张图。检查台面对的是反方向：手里只有图，要说出场景是什么样。",
        "en": "Graphics starts from objects, light and a camera and renders an image forwards. The station faces the other way: it holds only the image and must say what the scene is like."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关的问题是：只看这一张图，红色箱子离相机多远？几个候选场景都渲得出这张图。一句话在每个候选场景里都对，才算成立；都错是不成立；有对有错就是无法确定。",
        "en": "This level asks: from this image alone, how far is the red box from the camera? Several candidate scenes all render this image. A statement true in every candidate holds, false in every one does not hold, and true in some, false in others is undetermined."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "从图像推回场景是<wiki-ref to=\"inverse-problem\"></wiki-ref>：不同的场景能渲出同一张图。",
    "en": "Going from the image back to the scene is an <wiki-ref to=\"inverse-problem\"></wiki-ref>: different scenes can render the same image."
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "0C1",
      "kind": "choice",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "判断关于场景的每句话：成立、不成立，还是无法确定。",
        "en": "Judge each statement about the scene: holds, does not hold, or undetermined."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "箱子在图里的大小，取决于它有多大，也取决于它有多远。",
          "en": "How big the box looks in the image depends on how big it is, and also on how far away."
        }
      ],
      "judge": "claims",
      "rounds": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "红色箱子离相机 2 米。", "en": "The red box is 2 m from the camera." },
              "claim": { "depth": { "object": "box", "z": 2 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "箱子是红色的。", "en": "The box is red." },
              "claim": { "colour": { "object": "box", "is": "red" } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "箱子高 0.5 米。", "en": "The box is 0.5 m tall." },
              "claim": { "height": { "object": "box", "h": 0.5 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "箱子是蓝色的。", "en": "The box is blue." },
              "claim": { "colour": { "object": "box", "is": "blue" } }
            }
          ],
          "scenes": [
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "box",
                  "class": "box",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.3, 0.5, 3], "size": [0.5, 0.5, 0.5] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "box",
                  "class": "box",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.6, 0.5, 1], "size": [1, 1, 1] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "box",
                  "class": "box",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.9, 0.5, -1], "size": [1.5, 1.5, 1.5] }]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "画面里有两个立方体。", "en": "There are two cubes in the scene." },
              "claim": { "count": { "class": "cube", "n": 2 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "绿色立方体离相机 2 米。", "en": "The green cube is 2 m from the camera." },
              "claim": { "depth": { "object": "green", "z": 2 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "场景里有一个球。", "en": "There is a ball in the scene." },
              "claim": { "exists": { "class": "ball" } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "黄色立方体在画面里看得见。", "en": "The yellow cube shows in the picture." },
              "claim": { "visible": { "object": "yellow" } }
            }
          ],
          "scenes": [
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "yellow",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "yellow",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-0.9, 0.2, 2.5], "size": [0.4, 0.4, 0.4] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "green",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "green",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.5, 0.6, 3], "size": [0.5, 0.5, 0.5] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "yellow",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "yellow",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-0.9, 0.2, 2.5], "size": [0.4, 0.4, 0.4] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "green",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "green",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.75, 0.65, 2], "size": [0.75, 0.75, 0.75] }]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "naive": {
        "picks": [
          [["supported"], ["supported"], ["supported"], ["contradicted"]],
          [["supported"], ["supported"], ["contradicted"], ["supported"]]
        ],
        "why": {
          "zh": "按箱子在图里的大小定出了一个距离：可小而近的箱子和大而远的箱子渲出同一张图，距离和高度在候选场景里各不相同。",
          "en": "That reads one distance off the box's size in the image, but a small near box and a large far one render the same picture: depth and height differ between the candidate scenes."
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
